     systems, this limit was defined in the non-standard header <_s_y_s_/_p_a_r_a_m_._h>
     as MAXHOSTNAMELEN, and counted the terminating null.  The sseetthhoossttnnaammee()
     function and the error returns for ggeetthhoossttnnaammee() are not standardized.

